Audit finding (subsetting/modification): clause 4, item 1 above states that, absent Alibaba's
written authorization, no one may "对阿里巴巴字体进行仿制、转换、翻译、反编译、反向工程、拆分、破解"
("copy/reproduce, convert, translate, decompile, reverse-engineer, SPLIT (拆分), or crack" the
Alibaba font). Font subsetting is a form of splitting the shipped font file, which this clause
places under the written-authorization requirement rather than a general permission. Absent such
written authorization, this project ships the ORIGINAL, unmodified PuHuiTi 3 font files as
distributed (see `src/assets/fonts/AlibabaPuHuiTi-*.woff2`) — no subsetting is performed.
